  "dct_description_sm": [
    "Scan of the 1949 edition of the Kingsley, Florida, topographic map at 1:24,000 scale (7.5 x 7.5 minute series), published by the U.S. Geological Survey, the U.S. Army Corps of Engineers, and the War Department. Aerial photographs from 1976; field checked in 1949; photo inspected in 1984; photo revised in 1978; last revised in 1978; printed in 1990.",
    "Variations: woodland tint. Sheet size: 21.9 x 26.7 inches. Printed projection: Polyconic; horizontal datum: NAD27. From the USGS Historical Topographic Map Collection."
